  "release_notes": [
    "Introduces the Qt-based v1.2.0 interface while preserving the existing Quotation Manager data model and schema 10.",
    "Standardizes shared UI behavior across pages, dialogs, dropdowns, History, Revision History, responsive layout, hover states and dark-mode palette usage.",
    "Improves Quotation Word alignment so the header, reference/date, address, item table and Terms share one printable content boundary.",
    "Improves Proforma and Tax Invoice PDF/Excel Terms & Conditions layout so wrapped content remains inside the closing bordered area with readable sizing.",
    "Preserves the hardened OTA HTTPS trust path, hostname verification, certificate verification, TLS 1.2+ requirement, approved-host restrictions, installer SHA-256 verification and size verification."
